      "content": "KINGS LANGLEY          \tCHIPPERFIELD ROAD TL 00 SE  \t\t\t\t\t(South side)                                        7/120                                   \tBalls Pond Farmhouse -                                        \t(Holdings No. 1                                         \tand No. 2) GV                                      \tII House, now 2 houses. Mid C18 incorporating C17 service wing at NW, early C19 parallel rear extension. Red brick with tiled roofs. A tall 2 storeys and attics house facing S with internal chimneys. Fine S front with plaster coved eaves and end bays breaking forward slightly. 1:3:1 window pattern of large 2-light casement windows with segmental arches. Large 6/6 panes sash window in segmental arched recess to each end of ground floor. Middle has triple sash windows and a C19 gabled porch. 3 hipped dormers with 2-light Yorkshire sliding casements. 2-storeys rear range, 3 windows wide with studded plank door. C17 part tile hung with projecting gable and truncated external chimney on W. Listing NGR: TL0648702823"
    }
  ],
